Description: Je Regrette, 4k intro by Fit and Bandwagon (2004)
 Je Regrette is a 4k intro for Linux by the Finnish demogroups Fit and
 Bandwagon, released at Assembly 2004 where it ranked 5th in the combined
 4k intro competition.
 .
 A text cylinder, a wireframe red sphere and music-synced stripes and
 triangles with motion blur and glow, driven by a small software
 synthesizer, using SDL and OpenGL.
 .
 Credits: Marq (code, soft synth) and neckfreak (code, effects, music).
